1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,781
One.

2
00:00:00,781 --> 00:00:02,630
It is restricted to water.

3
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:07,408
Let ammonia gas and hydrogen chloride gas meet in air.

4
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:10,611
A white smoke of ammonium chloride forms.

5
00:00:10,611 --> 00:00:17,265
That is clearly a neutralisation, but there is no water and no hydroxide ion anywhere.

